        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>5.31\" x 2.17\" Modern Stainless Steel Rectangular Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern stainless steel rectangular flush pull is great for lightweight sliding doors such as barn doors or pocket doors. The 5.31 inch rectangular satin stainless steel flush pull is installed with 2 screws on the top and bottom edges. It has a satin stainless steel finish, which helps to hide finger prints. Made from 100% 304 stainless steel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-FP412-135B-specifications.gif?v=1704354532\" width=\"600\" height=\"221\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Canaropa FP412-135B Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Canaropa FP412-135B Modern Stainless Steel Pocket Door Handles:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 5.31</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2.17</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: .45</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .52</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 3 .94</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: .98</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Height: 4.56</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Width: 1.34</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Depth: .50</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 5/16\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-FP412-135B-specifications.pdf?v=1691095008\" target=\"new\"><b>Canaropa FP412-135B Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
